From 6aea71fd479c6ae9db74d9c319e0d38520b7eead Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:52:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Gluon adjust queue: per-server flag, CurrencyServerSync,
 ack and movements

Add currency.server_queue_servers (empty = all mc-azlink) and enabledFor().
Queue direction=adjust with a signed amount; site copy updates at enqueue
except reconcile. Ack stores balance_after, reverts failed adjust, and
syncs to_server/from_server site copies. Movements store deltas/site_op_id
and update the mirror unless the movement came from a site op.
